BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Skincare Routine//Dermatologist Schedule//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Professional Skincare Routine
X-WR-CALDESC:Dermatologist-level skincare routine — AM + PM with active serum rotation

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:am-skincare-routine-daily@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260413T070000
DTEND:20260413T073000
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY
SUMMARY:☀️ AM Skincare Routine — Daily
DESCRIPTION:MORNING ROUTINE (30 min) — Apply in this order:\n\n1. CLEANSE\n   • Gentle pH-balanced face wash\n   • Lukewarm water\, massage 30–60 sec\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto DAMP skin\n   • Pat gently — do not rub\n   • Deep hydration + barrier repair\n\n3. VITAMIN C SERUM — Minimalist Vitamin C + E + Ferulic 16%\n   • 4–5 drops to face & neck\n   • Antioxidant shield + brightening\n   • ⚠️ Store in cool\, dark place — discards if dark orange/brown\n\n4. HYDRATING SERUM — Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2%\n   • 3–4 drops on STILL-DAMP skin\n   • PGA holds 5× more moisture than HA alone\n\n5. MOISTURIZER — Dr. Sheth's Ceramide & Vitamin C Oil-Free Moisturizer\n   • Thin even layer\n   • Ceramides fortify barrier\, oil-free = ideal for AM\n\n6. SUNSCREEN — Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun SPF 50+ PA++++\n   • Apply 2 finger-lengths (≈1/4 tsp for face)\n   • ☀️ NON-NEGOTIABLE — reapply every 2–3 hrs if outdoors\n\n⚠️ AM RULES:\n• NEVER use Retinol in the morning — photosensitivity risk\n• NEVER use AHA/BHA Peel in the morning\n• Apply serums on DAMP skin (except Retinol — always dry)
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:☀️ AM Skincare Routine in 15 minutes — Start getting ready!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-monday-niacinamide@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260413T210000
DTEND:20260413T213000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Monday: Niacinamide 10%
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Monday Active: Niacinamide 10%\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser — removes sunscreen\, sebum\, makeup\n   • Step 2: Water-based cleanser — deep clean\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin\n   • Pat gently — snail mucin accelerates overnight repair\n\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\n   • 4–5 drops to face & neck\n   • Sebum regulation\, pore refinement\, tone evening\n   • Safe to layer over essence\n   • ✅ Niacinamide is gentle — ideal for Monday to kick off the week\n\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer\n   • Ceramides + Betaine repair barrier overnight\n   • B12 calms redness & inflammation\n\n💡 TIPS:\n• Niacinamide is safe with almost everything\n• Do NOT use Vitamin C (AM only) on the same layer as Niacinamide at low pH\n• Tomorrow is Retinol night — ensure skin is well-hydrated tonight
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🌙 PM Skincare (Niacinamide) in 15 minutes — Wind down and prep!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-tuesday-retinol@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260414T210000
DTEND:20260414T213000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Tuesday: Retinol 0.3%
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Tuesday Active: Retinol 0.3%\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser — removes sunscreen\, sebum\, makeup\n   • Step 2: Water-based cleanser — deep clean\n   • PAT DRY COMPLETELY before applying Retinol\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin — allow to absorb 2–3 min\n   • Can act as a buffer before Retinol if you experience sensitivity\n\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Retinol 0.3%\n   ⚠️ APPLY TO COMPLETELY DRY SKIN\n   • Wait 20–30 min after cleansing before applying\n   • 3–4 drops — thin layer\, avoid eye area & lips\n   • Anti-aging\, cell turnover\, texture refinement\n   • Do NOT apply to damp skin — increases irritation risk\n\n4. WAIT 20 MINUTES before moisturizer (buffer time)\n\n5. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer — locks in Retinol\n   • Ceramides reduce Retinol-related dryness\n\n⚠️ RETINOL WARNINGS:\n• NEVER combine Retinol + Vitamin C in the same routine\n• NEVER combine Retinol + AHA/BHA Peel (chemical burn risk)\n• Retinol causes photosensitivity — ALWAYS use SPF 50+ next morning\n• Weeks 1–2: Use Retinol only 1× per week if new to it\n• Expect mild tingling in first 2–4 weeks — this is normal\n• If peeling/redness occurs\, skip Retinol for 1 week
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🌙 PM Skincare (Retinol) in 15 minutes — Cleanse & dry skin before applying!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

