DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Wednesday Active: Niacinamide 10%\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser\n   • Step 2: Water-based cleanser\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin\n   • Extra soothing after last night's Retinol\n\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\n   • 4–5 drops to face & neck\n   • ✅ RECOVERY DAY — Niacinamide soothes redness from Retinol\n   • Repairs skin barrier\, reduces post-Retinol inflammation\n   • Anti-inflammatory + sebum regulation\n\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer — extra barrier support tonight\n\n💡 RECOVERY NIGHT TIPS:\n• Be extra gentle with cleansing — no scrubbing\n• If skin feels dry/tight after Retinol\, add a few drops of Hyaluronic + PGA before moisturizer\n• No exfoliation tonight\n• Thursday is your second Retinol night — make sure skin has recovered
