BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-thursday-retinol@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260416T210000
DTEND:20260416T213000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Thursday: Retinol 0.3% (2nd Night)
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Thursday Active: Retinol 0.3% (Second Weekly Session)\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser — removes sunscreen\, sebum\, makeup\n   • Step 2: Water-based cleanser — deep clean\n   • PAT DRY COMPLETELY before applying Retinol\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin — allow to absorb 2–3 min\n\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Retinol 0.3%\n   ⚠️ APPLY TO COMPLETELY DRY SKIN\n   • Wait 20–30 min after cleansing\n   • 3–4 drops — thin layer\, avoid eye area & lips\n   • Second weekly Retinol session — builds collagen over time\n\n4. WAIT 20 MINUTES before moisturizer\n\n5. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer\n\n⚠️ RETINOL WARNINGS:\n• NEVER combine Retinol + Vitamin C in same routine\n• NEVER combine Retinol + AHA/BHA Peel (chemical burn risk)\n• Retinol causes photosensitivity — wear SPF 50+ tomorrow\n• Weeks 1–4: Skip Thursday Retinol\, add only after tolerance is built\n• If you experienced irritation Tuesday\, swap this for Niacinamide until Week 5
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🌙 PM Skincare (2nd Retinol) in 15 minutes — Dry skin before applying!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
