SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Friday: Niacinamide 10% (Pre-Peel Prep)
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Friday Active: Niacinamide 10%\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser\n   • Step 2: Water-based cleanser\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin\n\n3. ACTIVE SERUM — Minimalist Niacinamide 10%\n   • 4–5 drops to face & neck\n   • ✅ PRE-PEEL PREP — Niacinamide strengthens barrier before Saturday's AHA/BHA Peel\n   • Reduces potential irritation from tomorrow's chemical peel\n\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer — maximize barrier hydration before peel\n\n💡 PRE-PEEL TIPS:\n• Drink plenty of water today\n• DO NOT use Retinol tonight (Thursday's Retinol was last active)\n• Ensure skin feels calm and not irritated before tomorrow's peel\n• If skin is red or irritated from Retinol\, consider skipping the peel Saturday
