BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-saturday-aha-peel@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260418T210000
DTEND:20260418T213000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SA
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Saturday: AHA PHA BHA 32% Chemical Peel
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Saturday Active: AHA PHA BHA 32% Peel\n\n⚠️⚠️⚠️ CHEMICAL PEEL — READ CAREFULLY BEFORE USE ⚠️⚠️⚠️\n\n1. CLEANSE (SINGLE CLEANSE ONLY)\n   • Gentle water-based cleanser\n   • PAT COMPLETELY DRY — peel must be applied to DRY skin\n   • Wait 5–10 min for skin to fully dry\n\n2. APPLY AHA PHA BHA 32% PEEL — Minimalist\n   ⚠️ APPLY TO COMPLETELY DRY\, CLEAN SKIN ONLY\n   • Thin even layer to face — avoid eye area\, nostrils\, lips\n   • Contains: 25% AHA + 5% PHA + 2% BHA\n   • START with 5 min leave-on time (Weeks 1–4)\n   • MAXIMUM leave-on time: 10 min (Weeks 5+)\n   • Tingling/mild stinging is NORMAL\n   • If burning/significant irritation: RINSE IMMEDIATELY\n\n3. RINSE THOROUGHLY\n   • Rinse with cool water for 60+ seconds\n   • Pat dry gently\n\n4. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin — critical for post-peel repair\n\n5. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Generous layer — barrier repair after peel\n\n⚠️ PEEL RULES:\n• NEVER combine AHA/BHA Peel + Retinol (same night)\n• NEVER combine AHA/BHA Peel + Vitamin C (same routine)\n• NEVER leave on longer than 10 minutes\n• Use peel MAXIMUM 1× per week\n• ALWAYS use SPF 50+ next morning — post-peel skin is photosensitive\n• Skip peel if skin is sunburned\, broken\, or actively irritated\n• Weeks 1–2: SKIP this peel entirely\, use Niacinamide instead
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🌙 PM Skincare (Chemical Peel) in 15 minutes — Read the peel warnings before starting!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pm-sunday-hyaluronic@skincare-routine
DTSTART:20260419T210000
DTEND:20260419T213000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:🌙 PM Skincare — Sunday: Hyaluronic + PGA (REST DAY 💧)
DESCRIPTION:EVENING ROUTINE (30 min) — Sunday: Full Rest & Hydration Day\n\n✅ NO ACTIVES TONIGHT — Barrier recovery & deep hydration only\n\n1. DOUBLE CLEANSE\n   • Step 1: Oil cleanser\n   • Step 2: Gentle water-based cleanser\n   • Be extra gentle tonight — skin needs rest\n\n2. ESSENCE — COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\n   • 2–3 pumps onto damp skin\n   • Extra generous application tonight\n\n3. HYDRATION SERUM — Minimalist Hyaluronic + PGA 0.2%\n   • 4–5 drops onto DAMP skin\n   • PGA holds 5× more moisture than HA alone\n   • Replenishes moisture lost from this week's actives\n   • ✅ NO Retinol\, NO acids\, NO exfoliants tonight\n\n4. MOISTURIZER — Minimalist B12 + Repair Complex 5.5%\n   • Very generous layer — occlude moisture overnight\n   • Can use 2× the normal amount tonight\n\n💡 SUNDAY REST DAY TIPS:\n• Drink 2–3 extra glasses of water today\n• Get 7–8 hours of sleep — skin repairs during sleep\n• Reflect on the week: any irritation? Adjust next week's schedule\n• If skin felt sensitive this week\, consider dropping one Retinol session\n• This is your skin's recovery day — resist the urge to add actives
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:🌙 PM Skincare (Rest Day Hydration) in 15 minutes — No actives tonight, just hydration!
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

END:VCALENDAR
